WEBVTT

00:02.580 --> 00:03.550
- Find him?
- No!

00:03.580 --> 00:05.970
- He's not here.
- He's not there!

00:06.000 --> 00:07.600
Where did he go?

00:07.630 --> 00:09.300
Not here either!

00:13.340 --> 00:16.850
What's all the commotion about?

00:17.760 --> 00:19.810
Rokai has escaped.

00:22.390 --> 00:23.390
Unbelievable.

00:24.440 --> 00:25.770
Rokai?

00:32.280 --> 00:34.670
I can go to the Light Maiden!

00:34.700 --> 00:36.200
I'll go see her.

00:36.740 --> 00:39.660
<i>'lay, WW» Ya'!-</i>

02:11.290 --> 02:15.670
<i>Episode 10 The
Heart of the Hiruko.</i>

02:20.640 --> 02:22.550
It's hot.

02:27.810 --> 02:30.660
Look at these paddies.

02:30.690 --> 02:33.190
My spirit and my
stomach are sinking.

02:34.480 --> 02:38.900
I hear this valley has had
scant rain since last year.

02:59.680 --> 03:01.440
A skinny potato.

03:01.470 --> 03:03.890
Thief!

03:07.140 --> 03:08.610
That potato!

03:08.640 --> 03:10.230
You're with him?

03:11.650 --> 03:14.030
You took all the
food from the village!

03:14.060 --> 03:15.370
W-Wait, we're—.

03:15.400 --> 03:17.410
Give us back our
food! You thieves!

03:17.440 --> 03:18.410
Whoa!

03:18.440 --> 03:19.610
You!

03:22.410 --> 03:24.070
Whoa, this is bad!

03:32.960 --> 03:35.430
Man, why do we have
to get chased down?!

03:35.460 --> 03:37.720
If I see that guy again, I'll—.

03:37.750 --> 03:40.980
That's enough! Let
sleeping dogs lie.

03:41.010 --> 03:43.940
Besides, we need
to get back to Jubei.

03:43.970 --> 03:45.390
Let's go.

04:13.330 --> 04:14.540
Nice smell.

04:15.130 --> 04:16.590
Could it be...?

04:42.320 --> 04:44.740
She is the Maiden!

04:45.660 --> 04:47.460
I'm so happy to see you!

04:47.490 --> 04:51.420
What are you doing?! Stop!

04:51.450 --> 04:55.540
Stop this! Stop this now!

04:57.170 --> 04:58.170
Jubefl.

04:59.040 --> 05:01.840
Huh? Hey, hey, what was that?

05:24.240 --> 05:26.110
He's an easy mark.

05:28.570 --> 05:31.760
Don't underestimate Jubei!

05:31.790 --> 05:34.420
Oh, Master Yamidoro.

05:34.450 --> 05:38.180
You, too, go after Jubei.

05:38.210 --> 05:41.890
I will capture the Light Maiden.

05:41.920 --> 05:43.510
Yes, sir!

06:04.990 --> 06:06.240
Dear Maiden!

06:06.570 --> 06:08.630
Oh, dear Maiden,
are you all right?

06:08.660 --> 06:11.750
Please forgive me.
Are you hurt at all?

06:11.780 --> 06:14.760
Get away! Don't touch me!

06:14.790 --> 06:18.010
I'm sorry. Did I hurt you so?

06:18.040 --> 06:20.380
I didn't mean to drop you.

06:20.880 --> 06:23.470
I've been a klutz
since childhood.

06:23.500 --> 06:26.140
Grandma used to
scold me all the time.

06:26.170 --> 06:31.110
I'm such an idiot to have
dropped my beloved Maiden!

06:31.140 --> 06:34.110
Stupid! Stupid! Stupid!

06:34.140 --> 06:38.780
Stupid, stupid, stupid,
stupid, stupid, stupid, stupid.

06:38.810 --> 06:41.690
Oh! Dear Maiden, you can move!

06:41.900 --> 06:44.870
I thought I gave you such a
bad owie that you couldn't move.

06:44.900 --> 06:47.820
I'm glad. I'm relieved.

06:49.200 --> 06:51.410
Who are you?

06:52.620 --> 06:54.750
My name is Rokai.

06:54.780 --> 06:59.300
I came from Hiruko's village
to protect you, dear Maiden!

06:59.330 --> 07:00.330
Hiruko...

07:00.670 --> 07:05.520
Oooh, just as I expected.
Dear Maiden is so beautiful!

07:05.550 --> 07:11.770
Grandma said you must be like a lily
growing among the shade of the Hirukos.

07:11.800 --> 07:14.640
She was absolutely right.

07:15.430 --> 07:17.070
Oh, here!

07:17.100 --> 07:20.230
I brought this for dear Maiden!

07:24.440 --> 07:29.000
When I picked it, the flower
was absolutely beautiful.

07:29.030 --> 07:33.250
I carried it ever so carefully
as if I was carrying you.

07:33.280 --> 07:35.590
What happened?

07:35.620 --> 07:41.340
I'm very sorry I made
your flower look so ugly.

07:41.370 --> 07:43.220
Is the lily from the
village of Hiruko?

07:43.250 --> 07:45.810
Y-Yes! You're right.

07:45.840 --> 07:50.970
I wanted dear Maiden to
wear it in your hair, but...

08:00.020 --> 08:01.480
Dear Maiden?

08:02.060 --> 08:05.330
<i>I've thought that Hiruko were
just like their appearance...</i>

08:05.360 --> 08:11.440
<i>Hungry like beasts, a
group of gold diggers.</i>

08:14.740 --> 08:17.050
Thank you very much!

08:17.080 --> 08:19.970
You still accepted my flower,
even though it looked so lousy.

08:20.000 --> 08:22.430
Dear Maiden, I knew that
you were a kindhearted person!

08:22.460 --> 08:23.930
- I am so grateful.
- That's enough.

08:23.960 --> 08:27.060
I understand how you feel.
I can take care of myself,

08:27.090 --> 08:28.600
so why don't you go
back to the village?

08:28.630 --> 08:30.560
No! I cannot do that.

08:30.590 --> 08:34.150
I came all the way here
to protect dear Maiden!

08:34.180 --> 08:36.860
I don't need you to protect me.

08:36.890 --> 08:37.860
No!

08:37.890 --> 08:41.930
As long as you're with
Rokai, you're in safe hands!

08:47.400 --> 08:48.660
Not this way!

08:48.690 --> 08:51.250
I can smell those bad people.

08:51.280 --> 08:53.120
It's safe over there!

08:53.150 --> 08:54.460
Come, dear Maiden!

08:54.490 --> 08:56.790
It will be safe
going that direction.

08:56.820 --> 08:59.290
Let's go now, dear
Maiden! Let's go, let's go!

08:59.320 --> 09:00.320
Eh?

09:04.960 --> 09:07.540
Enough! Pesky monkeys!

09:14.300 --> 09:15.300
This way.

09:20.010 --> 09:24.030
Rokai, where are you taking us?

09:24.060 --> 09:25.440
We're almost there.

09:30.480 --> 09:32.440
Ah! Look, over there!

09:38.070 --> 09:40.240
Dear Maiden,
would you like some?

09:40.740 --> 09:43.500
You came here for this?

09:44.000 --> 09:46.470
You're not hungry?

09:46.500 --> 09:49.140
Then I will eat it.

09:49.170 --> 09:50.920
Stop that!

09:51.540 --> 09:52.140
Huh?

09:52.170 --> 09:54.560
How could you put
that in your mouth?

09:54.590 --> 09:57.180
A little smelly,
but it's delicious.

09:58.840 --> 10:02.390
Dear Maiden?! What
happened? Where are you going?

10:05.350 --> 10:08.660
You weren't pleased
with the flower after all.

10:08.690 --> 10:10.830
I'll go get a beautiful
one right now!

10:10.860 --> 10:13.190
Don't go too far!

10:24.160 --> 10:28.040
I can't believe it. How
he could possibly eat that?

10:39.220 --> 10:42.430
A bad smell. Oh, no!

10:48.390 --> 10:49.520
Who are you?

10:50.560 --> 10:53.570
I am Yamidoro. I
control the Kimon Clan.

10:54.570 --> 10:58.540
I've come to take the
princess of the lost kingdom.

10:58.570 --> 10:59.740
What?!

11:15.460 --> 11:20.180
If you don't want to be like those
trees and plants, do not move.

11:25.720 --> 11:33.720
Dear Maiden, where are you?

11:41.860 --> 11:44.040
Dear Maiden.

11:44.070 --> 11:49.950
Dear Maiden!

12:39.550 --> 12:43.010
Damn you, Jubei!

12:50.010 --> 12:55.100
Dear Maiden, where are you?

12:55.600 --> 12:57.650
Dear Maiden!

13:04.110 --> 13:07.090
Hey, you! Where
is my dear Maiden?!

13:07.120 --> 13:09.460
You're telling me!
That's my question!

13:09.490 --> 13:12.370
You abducted my dear Maiden!

13:13.500 --> 13:16.010
You're a Hiruko?
Then that means—.

13:16.040 --> 13:17.220
Give me back my dear Maiden!

13:17.250 --> 13:19.630
I'm tellin' you, I
don't have her!

13:33.560 --> 13:35.780
Can't do it. I'm hungry.

13:35.810 --> 13:38.440
Huh? What's with this guy?

13:45.990 --> 13:47.660
Oh, I smell Mr. Monkey.

13:50.740 --> 13:52.160
You bastard!

14:03.550 --> 14:04.550
What?

14:13.560 --> 14:14.810
Dear Maiden.

14:19.900 --> 14:23.400
Yes, Dear Maiden!

14:33.370 --> 14:35.080
Dear Maiden!

14:37.410 --> 14:39.330
Dear Maiden! Dear Maiden!

14:40.960 --> 14:42.790
Come!

14:45.670 --> 14:48.720
It's a little tight, but
please bear with me.

14:52.720 --> 14:55.060
Hmph, a Hiruko.

14:58.730 --> 14:59.890
After them.

15:11.160 --> 15:12.370
What happened?

15:12.990 --> 15:14.780
Please wait just one moment!

15:23.000 --> 15:25.040
Dear Maiden, here!

15:30.300 --> 15:32.730
Dear Maiden! This way!

15:32.760 --> 15:34.760
Fool!

15:37.220 --> 15:38.220
Rokai!

15:39.350 --> 15:40.740
MY back!

15:40.770 --> 15:42.030
Rokai, are you all right?

15:42.060 --> 15:46.940
Dear Maiden, here.

15:48.280 --> 15:52.320
Stop! Or you will rot away, too.

15:54.700 --> 15:56.580
All we need now is Jubei.

15:57.700 --> 15:59.410
Dear Maiden!

16:00.660 --> 16:02.790
Dear Maiden...

16:04.500 --> 16:06.540
What's the matter, Jubei?

16:19.520 --> 16:22.980
Hey, quit interfering!
I will kill him!

16:27.610 --> 16:29.860
Huh? What was that?

16:43.870 --> 16:46.380
I see your true identity!

17:30.960 --> 17:34.010
I am impressed
that you're still alive.

17:34.880 --> 17:38.390
I am Yamidoro, leader
of the Kimon Clan.

17:39.300 --> 17:43.520
Jubei Kibagami, you
are a formidable fighter.

17:44.310 --> 17:45.980
Thanks for the compliment.

17:46.940 --> 17:48.780
What did you do with Shigure?

17:48.810 --> 17:51.770
Rest assured, she's alive.

17:52.230 --> 17:57.330
With the half of the Dragon Stone
you possess, this will all be over.

17:57.360 --> 18:01.710
So how about joining our clan?

18:01.740 --> 18:03.550
No, thanks.

18:03.580 --> 18:06.250
Following commands
like a dog isn't my style.

18:07.000 --> 18:10.300
So you're a wild
beast, like your name?

18:10.330 --> 18:12.300
You may be right!

18:13.090 --> 18:14.380
Is that so?

18:16.920 --> 18:20.610
I can use a swordsman like you.

18:20.640 --> 18:22.430
You're persistent.

18:32.480 --> 18:34.290
What do you say, Jubei?

18:34.320 --> 18:35.620
Shut up!

18:35.650 --> 18:38.530
You'd rather die a dog's death?

18:39.610 --> 18:41.240
Better than that monkey!

18:41.740 --> 18:44.490
Is that so? Such a waste.

18:58.590 --> 19:01.760
Run! Now's your chance!

19:05.430 --> 19:06.430
After him!

19:28.450 --> 19:30.930
Hmph, a fool.

19:30.960 --> 19:32.460
Master Yamidoro.

19:33.130 --> 19:34.260
Where is he?

19:34.290 --> 19:35.640
We lost him.

19:35.670 --> 19:39.440
Is that so? Call everyone back.

19:39.470 --> 19:43.930
We will take the Light Maiden and
head for Lord Yamikubo's castle.

19:44.510 --> 19:45.510
Yes, sir.

20:06.620 --> 20:08.950
Hey! That was Shigure!

20:09.290 --> 20:11.180
Hmm, that's bad.

20:11.210 --> 20:14.430
I'll follow them. You
go look for Jubei!

20:14.460 --> 20:15.670
Gotcha!

20:21.840 --> 20:25.430
<i>I'm... hungry-</i>

20:28.850 --> 20:31.100
It's dried rice. Eat it.

20:31.730 --> 20:34.350
No... I can't.

20:34.940 --> 20:37.270
What? You're hungry, right?

20:38.150 --> 20:42.400
My dear Maiden said
to not be so greedy.

20:43.200 --> 20:45.500
What are you
talking about? Here.

20:45.530 --> 20:49.800
Please save my dear Maiden.

20:49.830 --> 20:52.880
Give her the lily.

20:52.910 --> 20:54.470
Lily?

20:54.500 --> 20:58.040
And tell her...

20:59.710 --> 21:04.930
Since childhood...
I have loved...

21:06.390 --> 21:09.100
the dear Maiden.

21:10.970 --> 21:15.570
I wanted to be of
help to dear Maiden.

21:15.600 --> 21:21.360
Please... don't hate me.

21:22.650 --> 21:24.120
Don't worry.

21:24.150 --> 21:26.740
Shigure wouldn't
hate any Hiruko.

21:39.210 --> 21:40.210
Jubefl.

21:41.750 --> 21:44.170
Whoa, what the hell?

21:44.920 --> 21:47.720
What's up? What happened, Jubei?

21:49.930 --> 21:51.440
They took Shigure.

21:51.470 --> 21:54.450
I know. The old fart
is following them.

21:54.480 --> 21:55.730
We'll follow them too.

21:57.310 --> 21:59.230
Let's hurry or we'll lose them!

23:29.650 --> 23:31.660
<i>Next Episode.</i>

23:32.570 --> 23:35.410
Having captured Shigure,
the Kimon head for the sea.

23:36.040 --> 23:37.880
Yet her companions
are close behind.

23:37.910 --> 23:43.140
Riding the same boat is Renya
Yagyu, the leader of the Yagyu clan.

23:43.170 --> 23:46.460
Like Jubei, Renya
is after the Stone.

23:46.960 --> 23:52.720
A strange girl hiding in the
fog only complicates matters.

23:53.220 --> 23:56.650
<i>Next time on Ninja
Scroll: RenyaYagyu.</i>

23:56.680 --> 23:56.820
<i>Episode 11 Renya Yagyu.</i>

23:56.850 --> 23:57.860
<i>Episode 11 Re nya Yagyu Witness.</i>

23:57.890 --> 24:01.310
<i>Episode 11 Renya Yagyu</i>
